  "description": "Love the journeyGliding from A to B has never been this fun. The LYFE e-Bike energises you to get on and go, to tackle cross city trips and beyond with confidence, speed and joy.LYFE keeps it breezy with a relaxed riding position and ergonomically designed contact points. Hop on and enjoy a comfortable ride that allows you to take in the world as you navigate the streets and trails amid the ebb and flow of daily life. At just 17kg (size large Equipped), LYFE is the apartment dwellers friend, as it is easy to lift and easy to live with.Electric assistance is delivered by the rear hub drive Smartbike X35 system, manufactured by German automotive manufacturer MAHLE. The 36V 250W motor provides ample assistance for you to keep pace with traffic and cruise uphill, ensuring you reach your destination fast, with a smile upon your face.The LYFE electric city bike has up to 75km range between charges so you can ride on in confidence as you power to your destination. When the mood strikes to work a little harder, the integrated iWoc controller allows you to select from three assistance levels on the fly, so you can choose when to sweat and when to glide.",
